# Global rules for Claude

Loaded for every Claude Code session as per-user global instructions. The bulk
below is shared with Codex — edit it once in
`.chezmoitemplates/ai-common.md`, never in this file's copy of the rendered
output.

The rule files that section indexes load themselves: `~/.claude/rules/*.md` are
read at session start — universal rules always, frontend rules only when
matching files are in play (`paths:` frontmatter). The index is a summary; those
files are the source of truth.

## Tool preferences (Claude Code specific)

- Use Read/Edit/Write/Bash dedicated tools (NOT cat/sed/awk/echo via Bash)
- Prefer `rg` over `grep`, `fd` over `find` when available
- For long-running commands, use `run_in_background: true`
- Quote file paths with spaces in shell commands

